    "evidence": "The oversized two-tone thesis—“The signature is valid. The intent was stolen.”—is a sharp, repeatable visual and verbal hook. The cyan-to-red evidence path, ending in “AUTHENTIC ≠ INTENDED,” turns the security argument into a demo-worthy forensic narrative rather than a generic dashboard. It remains recognizable across all three viewports, though mobile loses the connecting-path drama and becomes a more conventional card stack.",
